# The "phone role" for Phosh: dialer (Calls), SMS (Chatty), MMS, Contacts,
# ModemManager auto-config, and a file manager. Installed when desktop=phosh.
# Verified on rhodep: installing mobian-phosh-phone made the Phone/Contacts/
# Messages apps appear in the Phosh drawer by default.
mobian-phosh-phone
nautilus
